  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 COD - Settlement Names v9.0",
    "description": "The GRID3 COD - Settlement Names v9.0 dataset consists of settlement points with name, location, and other attributes for all the twenty-six provinces in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (COD). The current version supersedes the GRID3 COD - Settlement Names v8.0 < https://doi.org/10.7916/qpnw-1c89 >. The following changes were made: - The data for Haut-Katanga, Haut-Lomami, Ituri, Kwango, Lomami, Maniema, and Tanganyika provinces were updated. This dataset should be considered operational; it has not been fully validated by government authorities. Keywords: Settlements",
